{#
  What a review reviews (TASK-432): its `p-item`, an h-cite or for a place an
  h-card, with its picture beside its details, and its rating as stars and as
  words, the `p-rating` out of the `p-best`. An entry includes it with
  `review` on the context; a listing sets it from the entry it is printing.
  Nothing is printed for a post that is no review.
#}
{% if review %}<div class="review">{{ review.html | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
